# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/merchant/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### GetMerchantAgreement(当前生效协议)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/GetMerchantAgreement
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### SubmitApplication(写 dev 库; 响应里的 applicationId 存进 client.global 供下面用)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/SubmitApplication
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{
  "companyName": "http-client 测试公司",
  "creditCode": "91110000MA01ABCD2X",
  "legalPerson": "测试",
  "legalPersonId": "110101199001011234",
  "contactPhone": "13800000000",
  "businessLicenseUrl": "https://example.com/license.png",
  "legalPersonIdFrontUrl": "https://example.com/id-front.png",
  "legalPersonIdBackUrl": "https://example.com/id-back.png",
  "categoryIds": [1001],
  "remark": "http-client"
}

> {% client.global.set("application_id", response.body.applicationId); %}

### GetApplication(用上一步的 id)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/GetApplication
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"applicationId": "{{application_id}}"}

### ApproveApplication(需要管理员身份头; 直连用 x-md-global-role 模拟)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/ApproveApplication
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}
x-md-global-role: admin

{"applicationId": "{{application_id}}", "auditComment": "http-client 通过"}

### RejectApplication
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/RejectApplication
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}
x-md-global-role: admin

{"applicationId": "{{application_id}}", "reason": "http-client 驳回"}

### CreateMerchant
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/CreateMerchant
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"phone": "13800000000", "mail": "test@example.com", "agreementVersion": "v1"}

> {% if (response.body.merchantId) client.global.set("new_merchant_id", response.body.merchantId); %}

### ActivateMerchant
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/ActivateMerchant
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"merchantId": "{{new_merchant_id}}", "shopName": "http-client 测试店", "shopLogoUrl": ""}

### ApproveApplication(LAN 网关, 需管理员 JWT)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/merchant.v1.MerchantService/ApproveApplication
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"applicationId": "{{application_id}}", "auditComment": "gateway 通过"}
